Modifications: added wechat_assistant for structured ingestion, local project
tracking, Codex analysis, scheduled notifications, a local UI and MCP retrieval.
Upstream wechat_cli remains the database decoding implementation.

Windows Config.Cipher compatibility is adapted from maomao3334/wechat-cli-plus
https://github.com/maomao3334/wechat-cli-plus
Commit: 75a322dd09c7c498536d10ff6935c5d52fd5fd2b
Apache-2.0. Adapted file: wechat_cli/keys/scanner_windows.py.
Local implementation: wechat_cli/keys/config_cipher.py.

Image container layout, global_config key derivation offsets and key candidate
scanning were informed by fanyuantaier/wechatauto-replica (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/fanyuantaier/wechatauto-replica
Commit 733394e42d5d099733a2319ddbddc24d77374042, wechatauto/media.py and db.py.
Local implementation: wechat_assistant/images.py. No sending or UI automation
components from that project are included.

Additional modifications: user-configured local projects, stdio MCP configuration
and feedback tools, opt-in background analysis, and explicit account selection
when multiple local WeChat directories are present in non-interactive mode.

Additional modifications: metadata-first conversation discovery, account-scoped
group-member/private-chat matching using the upstream contact schema, explicit
user-confirmed conversation associations, and bounded paged message retrieval.

Additional modifications: versioned project notes with cited message and
attachment coverage, content-based incremental review, and verified local
attachment copies that preserve original files and content versions.
